  "notes": "Surmai trip planner dashboard. Desaturated slate-blue (#6b7a99) is the single brand hue: sidebar rail, primary 'New Trip' button, pill text and placeholder icons. Active rail item is a white rounded square with shadow. Trip cards mostly show a light gray placeholder with a line image icon where no cover is set; only Costa Rica has a photo. Cards show a hover shadow and a slate edit-pencil strip on the cover. Destinations appear as small uppercase rounded pills (not status badges). Footer and sidebar are fixed (footer overlaps content in full-page capture). Clicking a card opens a trip detail page with tabs (Organization, Itinerary, Attachments, Expenses, Notes) and accordion sections."
